[ Growls ]

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're trying to
get out of my arms.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So it's more like wiggling
was the problem?

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:09.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
-Okay.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:10.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They can't stay still.
-Now, was there --

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.860
Every time there's a dog shoot,
I like to think of the idiots

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are on the other side of
the camera going,

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
