Over here!"

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:18.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Screeching
and clicking teeth ]

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:20.266
-Can I assume those idiots were
in full effect here?

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:22.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah,
the same idiots backstage.

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:23.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, good.
They were lovely. I met them.

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:24.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
They were so nice.

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
You would never have guessed
what idiots they were.

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:28.942 line:92%
-My hair and makeup. No...

